    "brief": {
      "application": "Use AWS for this synthetic architecture qualification. Predict equipment maintenance needs from synthetic sensor histories and maintenance records. Include ingestion, feature preparation, a versioned prediction model, held-out evaluation, drift monitoring and an operator work-order draft. No automatic equipment control. Draw the complete end-to-end architecture with concrete service choices and connected flows. Explain the first local test, distinguish mocked model behavior from actual model validation, and ask one useful missing-decision question. Do not reduce this application to storage to satisfy generator coverage. Do not invent successful deployment or approved region/account access.",
      "cloud": "AWS"
    },
